# Public listing route:
#   1. Replace ehemaliger56-debug in all three URLs below.
#   2. Put the release ZIP on a GitHub Release (see README.md here).
#   3. Validate with netkan.exe --verbose ConformalHeatShields.netkan
#   4. Open a PR adding this file as NetKAN/ConformalHeatShields.netkan
#      in https://github.com/KSP-CKAN/NetKAN
