# license: restricted = "All Rights Reserved" (official CKAN license string)

identifier: ConformalHeatShields
$kref: '#/ckan/github/ehemaliger56-debug/ConformalHeatShields'
name: Conformal Heat Shields
abstract: Decal-artige Hitzeschilde und aktive Hitzesenker für KSP 1.12.
description: |-
  Adds four radial peel-and-stik ablative heat shields (0.625 m to 3.75 m),
  scalable conformal decal coatings with four tile patterns, and four active
  heat sinks (CDH-4..7). The sinks pull interior and skin heat from every
  part in radius, store it for free up to their floor temperature, then bill
  the overflow to Ablator or ElectricCharge. They brown out when power runs
  dry and blow like a sacrificial fuse at 1800 K. CDH-7 projects a visible
  energy bubble, bills a flat EC/s per meter and suppresses Firefly reentry
  FX inside the field. All sinks can be switched on/off in flight via the
  right-click menu or action groups.
author: Liam
license: restricted
resources:
  homepage: https://github.com/ehemaliger56-debug/ConformalHeatShields
  repository: https://github.com/ehemaliger56-debug/ConformalHeatShields
  bugtracker: https://github.com/ehemaliger56-debug/ConformalHeatShields/issues
tags:
  - parts
  - physics
  - plugin
  - graphics
ksp_version: 1.12
depends:
  - name: ModuleManager
  - name: ConformalDecals
  - name: B9PartSwitch
  - name: ReStock
recommends:
  - name: Firefly
suggests:
  - name: SystemHeat
  - name: HeatControl
